  stepText:
  - Take the lane to Hoarfell through the Aurora Shear
  - Ride the currents down the ice ring
  - Follow the striped cutter down to Lastlight
  - Find Old Tern under the fourth rib
  - Hear Idra Sorn's plan at the carving yard
  - Cross the White Reach and go down to the bottom of the dig
  - Put the Host Marshal back to sleep
  - Go back to Old Tern, and sit down
  - Bring Idra's cutters home to Many Hands
